By crushing one more soul you reinforce your existing rime wraith, duplicating it out of its current host.

The new wraith will exist for [5, 6, 7, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns and cannot be used for another cast of Gelid Host.

When it is created the current host and all foes in radius 4 are blasted for [134, 180, 216, 246, 273 (TL1-5; SP 100)] cold damage.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
